1 NOTE <p>Note:  She was 1/512 Montauk Native American Indian</p><p><p></p></p><p><p>FAG# 5335378</p></p><p><p>Cleta Marcella Somerville was born to George and Cora Beardsley Somerville on October 21, 1923 i
2 CONC n Marlette, Michigan. Cleta graduated from Millington High School in 1941. Cleta was married to Alex Andreychuk on February 5, 1950 in Vassar, Michigan. Cleta is the much loved mother of Dale Andreych
2 CONC uk, Gail Andreychuk Josef and Alfred Andreychuk. Cleta is also grandmother of Eric, Matthew and Nicholas Andreychuk, and Katharine, John and Bryan Josef. Cleta devoted her life to her family and enjoy
2 CONC ed travel and gardening at the home she and her husband Alex built near the Cass River in Vassar. Cleta was also a devout member of First Baptist Church, Vassar. Cleta was the beloved sister of Gerald
2 CONC  Somerville, Lloyd Somerville, Neoma Somerville Curtis and Gil Somerville. Cleta passed away on July 2, 1996, at St. Mary's Medical Center, Saginaw. She was 72 years old. The Rev. Carl Briggs officiat
2 CONC ed at her burial in Riverside Cemetery, Vassar, Michigan.</p><p></p>
